  "prompt": "Album cover art for a heavy metal concept album titled 'Flooding Hell'. The scene depicts an apocalyptic battlefield with a vast army of identical clones storming the gates of Hell. Flames, molten rock, shattered chains, and a massive, shadowy devil figure trying to hold back the flood. In the distance, a divine light breaks through storm clouds, hinting at redemption. The style is gritty, dark, and intense, like a mix of H.R. Giger and heavy metal album art. Gothic font for the title 'Flooding Hell' at the top.",
